<title>HONG KONG: Dickson gets U.S. court okay on  Barney's pact.</title>
<headline>Dickson gets U.S. court okay on  Barney's pact.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dickson Concepts (International) Ltd said on Thursday that a United States bankruptcy court has approved its pact with New York luxury retailer Barney's on a financial review.</p>
<p>Barney's, which filed for bankruptcy nearly a year ago, announced last week that it would pay Dickson up to US$1 million to complete its financial review of Barney's and Dickson will submit a recapitalization proposal.</p>
<p>&quot;The Court Order approves the agreement between (Dickson) and Barney's,&quot; Dickson said in a statement.</p>
<p>It also said that it would consider whether to propose investing in Barney's until the review is completed.</p>
<p>--HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 28436441</p>
</text>
